&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: center"&gt;主な関係会社&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height: 35px"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 169px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 0px none ; border-bottom: 0px none "&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: left"&gt;物流事業&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 289px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 0px none ; border-bottom: 0px none "&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 12px; margin-right: 4px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -12px"&gt;・パレット等物流機器のレンタル事業（注）１&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 12px; margin-right: 4px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -12px"&gt;・パレット等物流機器の販売事業（注）２&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 12px; margin-right: 4px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -12px"&gt;・アシストスーツ事業（注）３&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 12px; margin-right: 4px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -12px"&gt;・物流IoT事業（注）４&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 190px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 0px none "&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: left"&gt;当社&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: left"&gt;ウベパレットサービス株式会社&lt;/p&gt;
